  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Mathematics Curriculum Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the Government&#x2019;s commitment to improving foundational learning by delivering a maths curriculum reform and providing complementary technical assistance. The project will mainly train 28,000 standard 3 and 4 teachers to teach the new curriculum effectively and distribute workbooks to more than 5 million standard 1-4 learners across Malawi&apos;s 5,936 primary schools.</narrative>
  </description>
